    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waffle Spin Ball is a wild, fast-paced pinball-style arcade game with a delicious twist! Wafle Spin Ball now has two game modes, Pinball and Paddleball each game mod allows you to battle through 5 worlds and 25 uniquely designed levels packed with chaos, challenge, and charm as you bounce, spin, and smash your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 10 distinct characters, each bringing their own flavor to the flipper-fueled or paddle-fueled frenzy. Whether you're mastering the art of timing or just trying to keep your ball alive, you'll find plenty to keep you coming back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect game-changing power-ups and avoid the dreaded power-downs as the action ramps up with each level. Want an extra edge? Uncover hidden cheats and unlock secret abilities to turn the tables!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for glory with your local high score or aim for the global spotlight with a networked high score leaderboard that ranks the top 5 players worldwide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waffle Spin Ball is a wild, fast-paced pinball-style arcade game with a delicious twist! Wafle Spin Ball now has two game modes, Pinball and Paddleball each game mod allows you to battle through 5 worlds and 25 uniquely designed levels packed with chaos, challenge, and charm as you bounce, spin, and smash your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 10 distinct characters, each bringing their own flavor to the flipper-fueled or paddle-fueled frenzy. Whether you're mastering the art of timing or just trying to keep your ball alive, you'll find plenty to keep you coming back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect game-changing power-ups and avoid the dreaded power-downs as the action ramps up with each level. Want an extra edge? Uncover hidden cheats and unlock secret abilities to turn the tables!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for glory with your local high score or aim for the global spotlight with a networked high score leaderboard that ranks the top 5 players worldwide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Waffle Spin Ball is a chaotic paddleball/pinball-inspired arcade game with 2 x 5 worlds and 25 levels, 10 playable characters, power-ups, power-downs, cheats, and both local and online high score leaderboards for each game mode. Bounce, blast, and climb the global Top 5!",
